msgstr "OpenAI-Crawler-Dokumentation"

#: inc/Admin.php:1531
msgid "GPTBot: OpenAI training"
msgstr "GPTBot: OpenAI-Training"

#: inc/Admin.php:1532
msgid "Use GPTBot separately when deciding whether crawled content may be used to train OpenAI generative AI foundation models."
msgstr "Verwende GPTBot separat, wenn du entscheidest, ob gecrawlte Inhalte zum Training generativer KI-Basismodelle von OpenAI verwendet werden dürfen."

#: inc/Admin.php:1533
msgid "Example: block OpenAI training"
msgstr "Beispiel: OpenAI-Training blockieren"

#: inc/Admin.php:1539
msgid "Googlebot: Search and AI features"
msgstr "Googlebot: Suche und KI-Funktionen"

#: inc/Admin.php:1540
msgid "For Google AI Overviews and AI Mode, keep normal Google Search crawling, indexing, and snippet eligibility in mind; there is no separate robots.txt token for those Search features."
msgstr "Für Google AI Overviews und AI Mode bleiben normales Crawling durch Google Search, Indexierung und Snippet-Eignung maßgeblich; es gibt keinen separaten robots.txt-Token für diese Suchfunktionen."

#: inc/Admin.php:1541
msgid "Example: allow Google Search crawling"
msgstr "Beispiel: Google-Search-Crawling erlauben"

#: inc/Admin.php:1544
msgid "Google AI feature guidance"
msgstr "Google-Leitfaden zu KI-Funktionen"

#: inc/Admin.php:1547
msgid "Google-Extended: Gemini training and grounding"
msgstr "Google-Extended: Gemini-Training und Grounding"

#: inc/Admin.php:1548
msgid "Use Google-Extended to limit training future Gemini models and grounding in some Google AI systems outside Search. Google says this token does not affect Search inclusion or ranking."
msgstr "Nutze Google-Extended, um das Training zukünftiger Gemini-Modelle und Grounding in einigen Google-KI-Systemen außerhalb der Suche einzuschränken. Laut Google beeinflusst dieser Token weder Aufnahme in die Suche noch Ranking."

#: inc/Admin.php:1549
msgid "Example: block Google-Extended"
msgstr "Beispiel: Google-Extended blockieren"

#: inc/Admin.php:1552
msgid "Google-Extended documentation"
msgstr "Google-Extended-Dokumentation"

